{"duration_api_ms":8884,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5129a575-4f79-4d24-8020-fb45eb1e02a8","total_cost_usd":0.0206686,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":659,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":758,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":363},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":659,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":758,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":659,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":659},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1226,"outputTokens":212,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.00022860000000000003,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":192,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":758,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":659,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.02044,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":363,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":659,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**The existing contract terminates automatically.** Section 15(a)(4) of the Investment Company Act of 1940 requires every advisory contract to provide for automatic termination on \"assignment.\" A change of control of the adviser is an assignment under Section 2(a)(4). Acquiring more than 25% of voting securities is presumed to be control.\n\n**A new principal advisory contract needs two approvals:**\n1. **The board**, including a majority of independent directors, under Section 15(c). These votes traditionally must be cast in person.\n2. **Shareholders**, by a \"majority of outstanding voting securities\" under Section 15(a). This means the lesser of:\n   - 67% of shares present, if more than 50% of shares are present, or\n   - more than 50% of outstanding shares.\n\n**Bridging the gap:** Rule 15a-4 lets the board approve an interim contract for up to 150 days while proxies are solicited. Fees can be no higher than under the old contract, and they are held in escrow until shareholders approve.\n\n**Section 15(f) safe harbor** applies to the selling adviser if, for three years, at least 75% of the board is independent, and, for two years, no \"unfair burden\" is imposed on the fund.","ttft_ms":4117,"type":"result","duration_ms":7593,"uuid":"2e630e88-fd72-48b4-8f80-368ba7d79b55","ttft_stream_ms":489,"time_to_request_ms":68,"first_content_frame_ms":489,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
